## AI assistance

From OpenGlassBox version > 0.2.1 onward, git commits may include
`Co-authored-by` / `AI Co-authored-by` trailers (Cursor, Claude, and similar
tools). Source file headers name only the human copyright holder; see git
history for AI co-authorship.
